#: setup.php
msgid "Periodic Export Cycle"
msgstr "Umjikelezo Wokuthekelisa Ngezikhathi Ezithile"

#: setup.php
msgid "How often do you wish Cacti to Export Graphs.  This is the unit of Polling Cycles you wish to export Graphs."
msgstr "Ufuna i-Cacti ikhiphe Amagrafu kangaki. Lena yiyunithi Yemijikelezo Yokuphola (Polling Cycles) ofisa ukukhipha Amagrafu ngayo."

#: setup.php
msgid "Every Polling Cycle"
msgstr "Njalo Ngomjikelezo We-Polling"

#: setup.php
#, php-format
msgid "Every %d Polling Cycles"
msgstr "Njalo Ngemijikelezo Ye-Polling Engu-%d"

#: setup.php
msgid "Hourly at specified minutes"
msgstr "Njalo ngehora ngemizuzu eshiwo"

#: setup.php
msgid "If you want Cacti to export static images on an hourly basis, put the minutes of the hour when to do that. Cacti assumes that you run the data gathering script every 5 minutes, so it will round your value to the one closest to its runtime. For instance, 43 would equal 40 minutes past the hour."
msgstr "Uma ufuna ukuthi i-Cacti ikhiphe izithombe ezimile njalo ngehora, faka imizuzu yehora okufanele ikwenze ngayo. I-Cacti icabanga ukuthi usebenzisa isikripthi sokuqoqa idatha njalo ngemizuzu emi-5, ngakho izosondeza inani lakho kulelo eliseduze nesikhathi sayo sokusebenza. Isibonelo, u-43 uzolingana nemizuzu engu-40 ngemva kwehora."

#: setup.php
msgid "Daily at specified time"
msgstr "Nsuku zonke ngesikhathi esishiwo"

#: setup.php
msgid "If you want Cacti to export static images on an daily basis, put here the time when to do that. Cacti assumes that you run the data gathering script every 5 minutes, so it will round your value to the one closest to its runtime. For instance, 21:23 would equal 20 minutes after 9 PM."
msgstr "Uma ufuna ukuthi i-Cacti ikhiphe izithombe ezimile nsuku zonke, faka lapha isikhathi okufanele ikwenze ngaso. I-Cacti icabanga ukuthi usebenzisa isikripthi sokuqoqa idatha njalo ngemizuzu emi-5, ngakho izosondeza inani lakho kulelo eliseduze nesikhathi sayo sokusebenza. Isibonelo, u-21:23 uzolingana nemizuzu engu-20 ngemva kuka-9 PM."

#: setup.php
msgid "Use x Threads"
msgstr "Sebenzisa ama-Thread angu-x"

#: setup.php
msgid "How many background threads do you wish Cacti to use when exporting graphs.  Default is 0 to run all export in poller thread, 1 or more to spawn separate background threads"
msgstr "Mingaki imicu yangemuva ofisa ukuthi i-Cacti iyisebenzise lapho ithekelisa amagrafu.  Okuzenzakalelayo ngu-0 ukuze konke ukuthekelisa kusebenze kumucu we-poller, u-1 noma ngaphezulu ukuze kusungulwe imicu yangemuva ehlukene"

#: setup.php
msgid "Graph Selection & Settings"
msgstr "Ukukhethwa Kwegrafu Nezilungiselelo"

#: setup.php
msgid "The user name to utilize for establishing permissions to Cacti Graphs.  This user name will be used to determine which Graphs/Trees can be exported.  N/A means don't assume any security is in place."
msgstr "Igama lomsebenzisi elizosetshenziselwa ukumisa izimvume zokufinyelela Amagrafu e-Cacti. Leli gama lomsebenzisi lizosetshenziselwa ukunquma ukuthi yimaphi Amagrafu/Izihlahla ezingathunyelwa ngaphandle. I-N/A isho ukuthi ungacabangi ukuthi kukhona ukuvikeleka okukhona."

#: setup.php
msgid "The Tree(s) to export."
msgstr "Izihlahla okufanele zithunyelwe."

#: setup.php
msgid "Expand Devices/Sites"
msgstr "Nweba Amadivayisi/Amasayithi"

#: setup.php
msgid "This setting determines if Tree Devices and Site Templates and Devices will be expanded or not.  If set to expanded, each host will have a sub-folder containing either Graph Templates or Data Query items."
msgstr "Lesi silungiselelo sinquma ukuthi Amadivayisi Esihlahla Nezifanekiso Zesayithi Namadivayisi kuzokwandiswa noma cha.  Uma kusethelwe kokwandisiwe, umsingathi ngamunye uzoba nefolda engaphansi equkethe Izifanekiso Zegrafu noma izinto Zokubuzwa Kwedatha."

