msgstr "Khipha Izithonjana"

#: setup.php
msgid "Check this if you want the export thumbnails mode."
msgstr "Maka lokhu uma ufuna imodi yokuthumela izithonjana."

#: setup.php
msgid "Clear Directory"
msgstr "Sula Uhla Lwemibhalo"

#: setup.php
msgid "Check this Checkbox if you wish this Graph Export to clear the final directory before populating."
msgstr "Maka leli Bhokisi lokumaka uma ufisa ukuthi lokhu Kuthunyelwa Kwegrafu kusule uhla lwemibhalo lokugcina ngaphambi kokulugcwalisa."

#: setup.php
msgid "Export Directory"
msgstr "Inkomba Yokukhipha"

#: setup.php
msgid "This is the directory, either on the local system or on the remote system, that will contain the exported data."
msgstr "Lona umkhombandlela, kungaba ohlelweni lwasendaweni noma ohlelweni olukude, ozoqukatha idatha ethunyelwe ngaphandle."

#: setup.php
msgid "Local Scratch Directory"
msgstr "Uhla Lwemibhalo Lwesikhashana Lwasendaweni"

#: setup.php
msgid "This is the directory that Cacti will temporarily store output prior to sending to the remote site via the transfer method.  The contents of this directory will be deleted after the data is transferred."
msgstr "Lona umkhombandlela lapho i-Cacti izogcina khona okwesikhashana okukhiphayo ngaphambi kokukuthumela kusayithi elikude ngendlela yokudlulisela. Okuqukethwe kwalo mkhombandlela kuzosuswa ngemva kokuba idatha isidlulisiwe."

#: setup.php
msgid "Remote Options"
msgstr "Izinketho Zokude"

#: setup.php
msgid "Sanitize remote directory"
msgstr "Hlanza ifolda ekude"

#: setup.php
msgid "Check this if you want to delete any existing files in the FTP remote directory. This option is in use only when using the PHP built-in ftp functions."
msgstr "Maka lokhu uma ufuna ukususa noma yimaphi amafayela akhona kuhla lwemibhalo olukude lwe-FTP. Le nketho isetshenziswa kuphela uma kusetshenziswa imisebenzi ye-ftp eyakhelwe ngaphakathi ye-PHP."

#: setup.php
msgid "Remote Host"
msgstr "Umsingathi Okude"

#: setup.php
msgid "Denotes the host to send Exported Graphs to."
msgstr "Ikhomba umsingathi okuzothunyelwa kuye Amagrafu Athunyelwe Ngaphandle."

#: setup.php
msgid "Remote Port"
msgstr "Imbobo Ekude"

#: setup.php
msgid "Communication port to use for the export method if non-standard (leave empty for defaults)."
msgstr "Imbobo yokuxhumana ezosetshenziselwa indlela yokukhipha uma ingeyona ejwayelekile (shiya kungenalutho ukuze kusebenze okuzenzakalelayo)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Use passive mode"
msgstr "Sebenzisa imodi engenzi lutho"

#: setup.php
msgid "Check this if you want to connect in passive mode to the FTP server."
msgstr "Maka lokhu uma ufuna ukuxhuma kumodi ye-passive kuseva ye-FTP."

#: setup.php
msgid "User"
msgstr "Umsebenzisi"

#: setup.php
msgid "Account to logon on the remote server (leave empty for defaults)."
msgstr "I-akhawunti yokungena kuseva ekude (shiya kungenalutho ukuze usebenzise okuzenzakalelayo)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Iphasiwedi"

#: setup.php
msgid "Password for the remote ftp account (leave empty for blank)."
msgstr "Iphasiwedi ye-akhawunti ye-ftp ekude (shiya kungenalutho ukuze kube yize)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Private Key Path"
msgstr "Indlela Yokhiye Oyimfihlo"

#: setup.php
msgid "For SCP and RSYNC, enter the Private Key path if required."
msgstr "Kwe-SCP ne-RSYNC, faka indlela ye-Private Key uma idingeka."

#: setup.php
msgid "Exported Cacti Graph Pages"
msgstr "Amakhasi Amagrafu e-Cacti Akhishiwe"

#: setup.php
msgid "(Edit)"
msgstr "(Hlela)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Izenzo"

